
**/.DS_Store
/.lake

# Where the GitHub Pages workflow assembles the book (Verso) and the API
# documentation (doc-gen4) before publishing.
/_site

# Output of `make` / `lake exe cswl-book <variant>`: one tree per variant,
# `_out/<variant>/{html,lean}`. All of it is generated — and `solutions/` and
# `grading/` contain answer keys, which this repository does not version (see
# the ban on `/Solutions/` below).
/_out

# Where the resources named in `CLAUDE.md` (CSwFP, fp-lean, sf-in-lean,
# logic_and_proof, ...) are cloned on this machine. Kept out of the repository
# because `CSwL` is public and distributed to students: a machine layout is of
# no use to them. The versioned `CLAUDE.md` carries each resource's name and
# upstream URL; only the paths live here.
/CLAUDE.local.md
